
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Briefly. It seems that every day there&#8217;s another service down or impacted. The first thing to know is that this is the week before Thanksgiving, and as a person who has run <a href="https://www.apple.com/store">online services</a> that need to perform on Black Friday, I can confirm that the two or three weeks before Black Friday is when a lot of complex work lands in order to support the traffic surge. I would assume that all industries that need to handle holiday traffic (digital or otherwise) are doing the same proactive work.</p>



